OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1788193203
OL,3,CNovak Djokovic loses in opening round
OL,4,Cof US Open for first time
OL,6,FNovak Djokovic grinded through
OL,7,Fphysical and internal ailments, made
OL,8,Fone mistake after another and could
OL,9,Fnot find what it took to beat a
OL,10,Ffeisty, younger opponent who was not
OL,11,Fintimidated under the lights against
OL,12,Ftennis' most decorated player.
OL,14,FThe 39-year-old is out of the US Open
OL,15,Fafter a first-round defeat to Mariano
OL,16,FNavone on Sunday night, losing 7-6
OL,17,F(5), 5-7, 4-6, 6-2, 6-1 in a five-set
OL,18,Fmarathon that lasted four hours and 36
OL,19,Fminutes.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1788193203
OL,3,CNovak Djokovic loses in opening round
OL,4,Cof US Open for first time
OL,6,FIt was the longest opening match of a
OL,7,FGrand Slam in Djokovic's career and
OL,8,Fbecame his earliest exit in one in two
OL,9,Fdecades, dating to the 2006 Australian
OL,10,FOpen. He had never lost in the first
OL,11,Fround at the US Open.
OL,13,F"I didn't enjoy myself," Djokovic
OL,14,Fsaid. "I think it was obvious that it
OL,15,Fwas an awful feeling on the court for
OL,16,Fme."
OL,18,FThe record holder with 24 major titles
OL,19,Fthrew up at least once and later
OL,20,Fappeared to be cramping when he
OL,21,Fgrabbed at his left foot.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1788193203
OL,3,CNovak Djokovic loses in opening round
OL,4,Cof US Open for first time
OL,6,FDjokovic swallowed pills brought to
OL,7,Fhim by a doctor and had his lower back
OL,8,Fmassaged during a medical timeout
OL,9,Fbetween the fourth and fifth sets, and
OL,10,Fhe grimaced after several shots.
OL,12,FDjokovic made 70 unforced errors in a
OL,13,Fpainful performance that ended mere
OL,14,Fminutes before midnight.
OL,16,F"It's something that I've been
OL,17,Fcarrying, unfortunately, pretty much
OL,18,Fevery match this year: vomiting,
OL,19,Fthrowing up, a serious issue there,"
OL,20,FDjokovic said.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1788193203
OL,3,CNovak Djokovic loses in opening round
OL,4,Cof US Open for first time
OL,6,F"Then my whole body starts to
OL,7,Fcollapse, basically cramping and pain.
OL,8,FYeah, the back just gave up in the end
OL,9,Fand shoulder, and I couldn't close it
OL,10,Fout," he added.
OL,12,FWith this defeat, 21 years to the day
OL,13,Fof his US Open debut, the question now
OL,14,Flingers as to whether this was
OL,15,FDjokovic's final match at this or any
OL,16,FGrand Slam.
OL,18,FAfter the loss, he said he was "trying
OL,19,Fto address really what's going on and
OL,20,Fhow far I can go this way."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1788193203
OL,3,CNovak Djokovic loses in opening round
OL,4,Cof US Open for first time
OL,6,FIt was clear Djokovic was not himself,
OL,7,Fand the wear and tear of sickness and
OL,8,Fsoreness took its toll.
OL,10,FThe No. 4 seed from Serbia cruised to
OL,11,Fearly 3-0 and 4-1 leads before blowing
OL,12,Fthem and losing the first set ` the
OL,13,Ffirst time that happened to him in the
OL,14,Ffirst round of the U.S. Open since '06.
OL,16,F"Just struggled all the way since the
OL,17,Ffourth game of the match," Djokovic
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1788193203
OL,3,CNovak Djokovic loses in opening round
OL,4,Cof US Open for first time
OL,6,F"When it comes to match itself and
OL,7,Foverall feeling of how I felt with
OL,8,Fbody and playing, it was really not
OL,9,Fenjoyable. I pretty much despised
OL,10,Fevery moment that I spent on the court
OL,11,Ffor that."
OL,13,FDjokovic also lost in the first round
OL,14,Fat the hardcourt tuneup in Cincinnati
OL,15,Fearlier this month. That was his first
OL,16,Faction since losing to top-ranked
OL,17,FJannik Sinner in the semifinals at
OL,18,FWimbledon.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1788193203
OL,3,CNovak Djokovic loses in opening round
OL,4,Cof US Open for first time
OL,6,FNavone, a 25-year-old from Argentina,
OL,7,Fwon his first ATP singles title
OL,8,Fearlier this year.
OL,10,F"(It) was very tough for me because
OL,11,Fyou are playing with the 'GOAT' on
OL,12,Fthis court," said Navone, who idolised
OL,13,FDjokovic growing up.
OL,15,F"For sure it's the best thing I've had
OL,16,Fon court. This is an amazing court and
OL,17,Fthe biggest stage. It's amazing, the
OL,18,Fway we play. I mean, five sets. ...
OL,19,FI'm very happy. I don't know. What can
OL,20,FI say?"
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
